A: Margin fell by 0.3 percentage points in 2025 Q1, from 31.7% in 2024 Q4 to 31.4%.

The company says the main cause was a 12% increase in unit costs from Voss Industrial at the start of the quarter, which it absorbed rather than passing through to customers.

